ont-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Provide thought leadership on usability and user-centered design principles. Evangelize design within and outside the organization.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Actively take part in hiring and take part in recruiting the best talent required for the team.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Mentor and inspire a team of designers. Help the team in raising the bar, resolving blockers, prioritizing and breaking down complex projects into simpler tasks.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Brainstorm and create new directions that Razorpay can take in our quest to make finance easy and accessible to all.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Envisage &amp; run strategic, design-only initiatives. For eg. fostering the design community, experiment with design practices, etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Mandatory Qualifications:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">As a Lead Product Designer, we expect you to have :</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">At least 7+ years of experience in designing digital products with 2+ years of experience in leading a team of designers.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Experience working in Agile/Scrum development processes.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Keen in understanding short and long-term goals of the product and business.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Excellent understanding of behavioral analytics and you go by data-driven decisions.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Expertise in UI and interaction design with a deliberate focus on raising the bar for UI.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Prior work experience focussing on Mobile applications and a good understanding of the platform.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">A good understanding of Frontend principles to guide the team from an engineering point of view.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Keen in applying user research, user-needs validation and usability evaluation.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Excellent communication and presentation skills and the ability to clearly articulate design decisions to the team and leadership.</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><