mpact of threats.</li>\n<li>Share critical incident updates with CISOs and security teams.</li>\n<li>Follow up on important incidents until there is action or closure.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Conduct Weekly Incident Triage</strong></h3>\n<p>You will work closely with analysts to review customer incidents every week.</p>\n<p>You will:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Review critical and high-severity incidents.</li>\n<li>Prioritize incidents based on customer context and business impact.</li>\n<li>Prepare clear customer-ready summaries.</li>\n<li>Ensure important incidents are not missed or buried in reports.</li>\n<li>Track which incidents were reported, acknowledged, and actioned.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Act as a Security Consultant to Customers</strong></h3>\n<p>You should enjoy working like a consultant.</p>\n<p>You will:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Understand the customer\u2019s environment.</li>\n<li>Ask the right questions.</li>\n<li>Investigate issues with analysts.</li>\n<li>Simplify complex threats.</li>\n<li>Connect findings to business risk.</li>\n<li>Advise customers on the next best action.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This role is not about passing information from one team to another. It is about helping customers understand risk and act with confidence.</p>\n<h2><strong>What We Are Looking For</strong></h2>\n<p>We are looking for someone who can understand cyber threats and explain them clearly to customers.</p>\n<p>The person should have interest or experience across:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Threat Intelligence.</li>\n<li>Dark web and deep web threats.</li>\n<li>Credential leaks and stealer logs.</li>\n<li>Brand impersonation.</li>\n<li>Data leaks.</li>\n<li>Infrastructure vulnerabilities.</li>\n<li>Attack surface exposures.</li>\n<li>Cloud and internet-facing risks.</li>\n<li>AI security risks.</li>\n<li>Third-party and vendor risks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The ideal candidate should have:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>3\u20137 years of experience in cybersecurity, threat intelligence, SOC, customer success, technical account management, security consulting, or security operations.</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of security incidents and business risk.</li>\n<li>Ability to communicate with both analysts and CISOs.</li>\n<li>Strong written and verbal communication skills.</li>\n<li>Curiosity to investigate and understand threats.</li>\n<li>Ownership mindset.</li>\n<li>Ability to use AI tools responsibly to improve investigation, summarization, and reporting.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Key Success Metrics</strong></h2>\n<p>The most important success metric for this role will be:</p>\n<p><strong>Number of successful incidents triaged and reported to customers.</strong></p>\n<p>Other metrics include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Number of critical incidents proactively communicated.</li>\n<li>Number of incidents acknowledged or actioned by customers.</li>\n<li>Quality of customer-ready incident summaries.</li>\n<li>Quality of weekly incident reviews.</li>\n<li>Customer feedback from CISOs and security teams.</li>\n<li>Adoption of relevant CloudSEK modules and workflows.</li>\n<li>Contribution to renewals and expansions through demonstrated value.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>What Success Looks Like</strong></h2>\n<p>A successful Customer Threat Advisor ensures that every assigned customer clearly understands:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What threats were discovered.</li>\n<li>Which incidents matter most.</li>\n<li>Why they matter.</li>\n<li>What action should be taken.</li>\n<li>What value CloudSEK delivered.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The best people in this role will not wait for escalations. They will proactively find value, explain risk, and help customers act before the issue becomes a crisis.</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Benefits of Joining CloudSEK</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We provide an environment where you can develop and enhance your skills while delivering meaningful work that matters. You\u2019ll be rewarded a competitive salary as well as a full spectrum of generous perks and incentives which include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Flexible working hours.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Food, unlimited snacks and drinks are all available while at office.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">And, the finest part is yet to come! Every now and then we ensure to unwind and have a good time together, which involves games, fun, and soulful music. Feel free to show off your artistic side here! </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CloudSEK is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. We encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>",
