 with cyber intelligence, and then provides workflows to manage and remediate all identified threats including takedown support.</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A powerful Attack Surface Monitoring</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">tool that gives visibility and intelligence on customers\u2019 attack surfaces. CloudSEK's </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>BeVigil </strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">uses a combination of Mobile, Web, Network and Encryption Scanners to map and protect known and unknown assets.</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CloudSEK\u2019s Contextual AI <strong>SVigil</strong> identifies software supply chain risks by monitoring Software, Cloud Services, and third-party dependencies.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Key Milestones:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2016</strong>: Launched our first product.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2018</strong>: Secured Pre-series A funding.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2019</strong>: Expanded operations to India, Southeast Asia, and the Americas.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2020</strong>: Won the NASSCOM-DSCI Excellence Award for Security Product Company of the Year.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2021</strong>: Raised $7M in Series A funding led by MassMutual Ventures.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Awards &amp; Recognition</strong>: Won NetApp Excellerator's \"Best Growth Strategy Award,\" CloudSEK XVigil joined NVIDIA Inception Program, and won the NASSCOM Emerge 50 Cybersecurity Award.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2025</strong>: Secured $19 million in funding led by Tenacity Ventures, Commvault.</span></li>\n</ul></div><p>The Technical Account Manager (TAM) is the primary post-sale point of contact for assigned accounts, blending commercial ownership with hands-on cybersecurity expertise to ensure clients realize continuous value from CloudSEK's platform. This is a travel-intensive role requiring at least 60% travel to customer sites.</p>\n<p>The TAM serves as a trusted advisor to client stakeholders \u2014 from security teams to CXOs, CISOs, and partners \u2014 driving engagement through QBRs/ABRs/EBRs, while also acting as a security analyst who triages platform findings, conducts configuration reviews, and delivers actionable threat intelligence. The TAM also owns the account's commercial health: driving product adoption, running product walkthroughs, identifying upsell/cross-sell opportunities, and ensuring on-time renewals to reduce churn and grow NRR.</p>\n<p>Success requires balancing customer advocacy with commercial accountability, coordinating with internal teams and partners to resolve issues and close wins, and channeling client feedback into product improvement \u2014 alongside contributing to team knowledge-sharing and training.</p>\n<h3><strong>Travel Requirements</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Extensive travel role \u2014 at least 60% travel to customer sites</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Relationship Management &amp; Customer Engagement</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Manage and nurture relationships with assigned accounts, ensuring high satisfaction and retention</li>\n<li>Be a trusted advisor to clients</li>\n<li>Develop and execute engagement strategies for key stakeholders (CXOs, CISOs, procurement teams, partners/distributors)</li>\n<li>Foster customer champions to drive advocacy and referrals</li>\n<li>Source referrals and participate in revenue generation and customer marketing events</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Business Reviews &amp; Reporting</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Conduct QBRs, ABRs, and EBRs to assess and enhance customer engagement</li>\n<li>Triage platform findings and report threat insights to clients frequently</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Technical &amp; Security Advisory</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Provide expert guidance on threat intelligence, data leak prevention, and cybersecurity issues</li>\n<li>Act as a security analyst, offering insights/recommendations based on platform-generated threats</li>\n<li>Conduct configuration reviews and provide product enhancement recommendations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Adoption &amp; Product Enablement</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Drive 100% adoption of CloudSEK's solutions with customer security teams</li>\n<li>Conduct independent product walkthroughs using battlecards/collateral</li>\n<li>Collaborate with the POC team for quick technical and financial wins</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Revenue Growth &amp; Renewals</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify upsell/cross-sell opportunities; own renewals and expansion in assigned accounts</li>\n<li>Collaborate with partners/distributors for smooth renewals and account expansion</li>\n<li>Ensure on-time renewals to reduce churn and increase NRR every quarter</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Feedback &amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Gather and analyze customer feedback for product development</li>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive product and delivery enhancements</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Operational &amp; Internal Contribution</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Maintain accurate records of customer interactions/activities in CRM</li>\n<li>Share knowledge, conduct training sessions, and write internal articles</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>What we are looking for:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Experience-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3+ years of experience in the cybersecurity industry, in a client-facing role such as Account Management, Customer Success, Technical Account Management, or Security Consulting</li>\n<li>Proven track record of managing renewals, driving upsell/cross-sell, and owning revenue targets (NRR/retention) for enterprise accounts</li>\n<li>Experience engaging with senior stakeholders (CXOs, CISOs) and navigating procurement/partner ecosystems</li>\n<li>Prior exposure to BFSI or other regulated-sector clients is a plus</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Technical/Domain Knowledge-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Working knowledge of cybersecurity concepts \u2014 threat intelligence, digital risk protection, data leak prevention, attack surface management, or brand/fraud monitoring</li>\n<li>Ability to independently interpret security findings/alerts and translate them into client-facing recommendations</li>\n<li>Comfortable conducting product demos, configuration reviews, and technical walkthroughs without heavy pre-sales/engineering support</li>\n<li>Familiarity with SaaS security platforms and their integration into customer security workflows</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong executive communication and presentation skills \u2014 able to run QBRs/ABRs/EBRs with CXO/CISO audiences</li>\n<li>Consultative, advisory selling approach \u2014 balances customer advocacy with commercial outcomes</li>\n<li>Analytical mindset for triaging findings, spotting expansion opportunities, and analyzing customer feedback</li>\n<li>Proficiency with CRM tools for pipeline and account record management</li>\n<li>Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Other Requirements-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Willingness to travel extensively (60%+) to customer sites</li>\n<li>Bachelor's degree in a relevant field (Computer Science, IT, Cybersecurity, or related); relevant certifications (e.g., CEH, Security+, CISM) are a plus but not mandatory</li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Benefits of Joining CloudSEK</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We provide an environment where you can develop and enhance your skills while delivering meaningful work that matters. You\u2019ll be rewarded a competitive salary as well as a full spectrum of generous perks and incentives which include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Flexible working hours.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Food, unlimited snacks and drinks are all available while at office.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">And, the finest part is yet to come! Every now and then we ensure to unwind and have a good time together, which involves games, fun, and soulful music. Feel free to show off your artistic side here! </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CloudSEK is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. We encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>",
