      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google\u2019s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home d\u00e9cor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world\u2019s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands \u2014 meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">Through Glance AI\u2019s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi\u2019s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.</p></div><hr>\n<p><strong>Overview of the Role:</strong></p>\n<p>Glance is at an inflection point. With over 250 million daily active users and a platform embedded at the heart of the Android ecosystem, we're not building for scale \u2014 we're already there. Now, we're looking for a Group Product Manager to join our U.S. Growth Team and lead where we go next.</p>\n<p>This is not a conventional PM role. Rather than executing against a pre-built roadmap, you'll own and shape it \u2014 identifying the growth levers, prototyping the ideas, pitching the vision, and driving the kind of orbit-shifting outcomes that move the needle on devices, DAU, and revenue at a global scale. You'll work at the intersection of product, technology, design, analytics, and business development, often all in the same week.</p>\n<p>If you thrive in ambiguity, move with urgency, and know how to drive outcomes without needing a large team behind you, this role was built for you. Startup DNA is a must. Hustle is non-negotiable.</p>\n<p><em>This role is based onsite in our San Mateo, CA, office and is not open to remote work.</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>The Impact You'll Make:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Own growth end-to-end.</strong> You will be directly responsible for driving user growth, device growth, and revenue growth for Glance globally, with a clear North Star of getting Glance onto as many devices as possible and meaningfully increasing Daily Active Users.</li>\n<li><strong>Vibe code your way to fast answers.</strong> Leverage AI-assisted development and rapid prototyping to independently build and test POCs at the Android or backend layer \u2014 validating ideas at speed before handing off to engineering to scale across millions of devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Design high-fidelity mocks that move the room.</strong> Create concept-ready, high-fidelity mockups used in pitches to OEMs and Telcos or to bring a POC to life. Our full-strength UX design team picks it up from there, and your job is to get it compelling enough to open the door.</li>\n<li><strong>Be the growth hacker.</strong> Identify and execute growth opportunities across the Android layer and device/system layer. Work closely with OEMs, Telcos, and system apps baked into the phone to unlock step-change growth in DAU and devices that others don't even see.</li>\n<li><strong>Own the funnel like a data analyst.</strong> Dig into activation, engagement, and retention data to uncover where users drop off and where the real opportunity lives. Turn those insights into actionable product changes that compound over time.</li>\n<li><strong>Pitch and close.</strong> Take new integration concepts, new surfaces, and new partnership models directly to OEMs and Telcos across the globe. You're part PM, part BD \u2014 comfortable presenting to senior stakeholders and walking away with a yes.</li>\n<li><strong>Drive agent adoption.</strong> As Glance deepens its investment in Consumer AI, you'll play a key role in driving meaningful AI agent usage across the platform, a critical growth frontier for the company.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>The Experience We Need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>10+ years of consumer product management experience, with a proven track record of building and scaling products that real people use every day.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with vibe coding, AI-assisted development, or rapid prototyping \u2014 the ability to spin up a functional POC independently is a genuine differentiator here.</li>\n<li>Strong analytical foundation: you're comfortable owning funnel analysis, retention modeling, and growth diagnostics without needing a dedicated data team to do it for you.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated ability to design high-fidelity product mocks and translate concepts into compelling visual narratives for external pitches.</li>\n<li>Experience working cross-functionally across tech, design, analytics, GTM, and business development: you know how to drive alignment and momentum across functions.</li>\n<li>Prior experience collaborating with Telcos, OEMs, or system integrators is a significant plus at this level, and familiarity with the Android ecosystem and device-level distribution is highly valued.</li>\n<li>Startup background strongly preferred. We're looking for builders and hustlers, not process managers. FAANG experience alone is unlikely to be the right fit for this environment.</li>\n<li>Exceptional communication and executive presence: you can pitch a vision to a Telco partner in Seoul and align an internal engineering team on the same day.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What we build\u2026</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">At Glance, we're building products that are redefining industries. Our ecosystem spans:\u202f</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Glance</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> \u2013 A revolutionary Gen AI-powered lockscreen &amp; TV content platform transforming how millions discover and engage with content</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">InMobi Advertising</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;\u2013 Powering data-driven mobile marketing for the world\u2019s leading brands</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">1Weather</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;\u2013 One of the world\u2019s leading weather platforms, delivering precise, reliable, and real-time weather forecasts</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">With deep&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in AI, mobile, consumer technology, and digital innovation, we are home to some of the brightest minds in the industry.\u202f</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What sets us apart?&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Not just what we build. How we build it. At Glance, we balance our hunger for cutting-edge tech with a deep focus on our people - their growth, well-being, and potential.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">At Glance</span></strong><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">,&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">you'll be surrounded by people who\u2026</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Think big and act fast:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u202fWe\u2019re&nbsp;entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u202fWe care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Own their outcomes:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u202fWe take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Embrace freedom with accountability:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u202fWe value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Believe in lifelong learning:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u202fWe welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and&nbsp;aren\u2019t&nbsp;afraid to take smart risks</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and&nbsp;pay&nbsp;parity. We&nbsp;determine&nbsp;compensation on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience, skills, and location.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The base salary (fixed) pay range for this role is from $272,000 to $324,000 USD </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">(min to max of base salary pay). This salary range&nbsp;is applicable&nbsp;to our offices&nbsp;located&nbsp;in California and New&nbsp;York</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>*</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">*Our ranges may vary based on final location and region of roles in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, a&nbsp;Glancer&nbsp;can receive equity in the form of a stock grant known as Restricted Stock Units (RSUs). To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we believe that our employees should have the ability to own a part of the organization. Furthermore, as you contribute to the growth of the company,&nbsp;additional&nbsp;stock may be issued in recognition of your contribution over time.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">A quick snapshot of our benefits:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&