      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google\u2019s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home d\u00e9cor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world\u2019s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands \u2014 meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">Through Glance AI\u2019s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi\u2019s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.</p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Glance</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> <br><br></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Since 2019, Glance has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Across 5 offices in around 3 countries, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has&nbsp;remained&nbsp;constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective,&nbsp;judgment&nbsp;and humanity you bring to&nbsp;the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong>Job Title: Motion Graphics Designer </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Bengaluru<br><strong>Department:</strong> Marketing \u2013 Creative Motion Design<br><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Full-time</p>\n<p><strong>About the Role</strong></p>\n<p>We are looking for an experienced <strong>Motion Graphics Designer</strong> who can independently handle projects end-to-end\u2014from understanding the brief to final delivery. You should be strong in design, great at storytelling through motion, and excited to keep learning and exploring new tools, trends, and <strong>AI-powered workflows</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Concept &amp; Storyboarding</strong></li>\n<ul>\n<li>Understand briefs and convert them into clear visual concepts and storyboards.</li>\n<li>Plan and design strong frames that tell a compelling visual story.</li>\n</ul>\n<li><strong>Design &amp; Animation</strong></li>\n<ul>\n<li>Create high-quality motion graphics for marketing campaigns, explainer videos, product videos, social media, app UI &amp; brand films.</li>\n<li>Ensure all visuals follow brand guidelines and maintain a high design standard.</li>\n<li>Work on both 2D and 3D motion graphics (3D preferred).</li>\n</ul>\n<li><strong>End-to-End Project Ownership</strong></li>\n<ul>\n<li>Own the full design process: ideation, storyboard, design, animation, and final output.</li>\n<li>Coordinate with marketing, product, and content teams to understand goals and deliver on time.</li>\n<li>Manage multiple projects and deadlines independently.</li>\n</ul>\n<li><strong>Collaboration &amp; Communication</strong></li>\n<ul>\n<li>Work closely with the creative, marketing, and product teams to build cohesive campaigns.</li>\n<li>Present concepts, style frames, and motion directions clearly, with logical reasoning.</li>\n</ul>\n<li><strong>Quality, Innovation &amp; AI</strong></li>\n<ul>\n<li>Stay updated on design, motion, UI/UX, <strong>AI tools</strong>, and technology trends.</li>\n<li>Use AI tools where relevant (for ideation, references, asset generation, optimisation, etc.) to speed up and enhance the creative process.</li>\n<li>Experiment with new styles, techniques, and tools (especially in 3D and interaction).</li>\n<li>Maintain high attention to detail and consistency across all assets.</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Required Skills &amp; Experience</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Experience:</strong> 5+ years in Motion Graphics / Motion Design.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools &amp; Software</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong expertise in <strong>Adobe After Effects</strong> and <strong>Adobe Premiere Pro</strong>.</li>\n<li>Solid skills in <strong>Adobe Photoshop</strong> and <strong>Adobe Illustrator</strong>.</li>\n<li>Experience working with <strong>Figma</strong>.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of any <strong>3D software</strong> (preference: <strong>Blender</strong>).</li>\n<li><strong>Familiarity with AI tools</strong> used in design and content creation (for example, AI image/video tools, AI assistants for workflows, etc.).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Design Skills</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong understanding of composition, colour, typography, and visual hierarchy.</li>\n<li>Ability to think through and design frame-by-frame storytelling.</li>\n<li>Ability to translate ideas, scripts, and briefs into clear, impactful visuals.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Portfolio</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A strong portfolio/showreel showcasing motion graphics across different formats (explainer videos, product videos, brand films, social content, etc.).</li>\n<li>Work samples that demonstrate independent project ownership are a big plus.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span class=\"ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea\">\"<em>Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse's Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on 'Submit 