      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google\u2019s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home d\u00e9cor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world\u2019s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands \u2014 meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">Through Glance AI\u2019s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi\u2019s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.</p></div><p><strong>About the Role</strong><br>Glance AI is building AI-native consumer experiences for millions of users.&nbsp;We are looking for a Product Manager who combines strong consumer-product judgment with a&nbsp;builder\u2019s mindset. Someone who thinks deeply about how a product feels and behaves, not just what<br>features it has.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You will own consumer-facing experiences end to end, from understanding the user problem and&nbsp;shaping the experience to launch, adoption, engagement, and iteration.&nbsp;This is a role for someone who moves fast, stays close to users and design, and is comfortable changing&nbsp;direction when a better idea emerges.</p>\n<p><strong>What You\u2019ll Own</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Own consumer journeys and experiences, not just individual features.</li>\n<li>Identify meaningful user problems and turn them into clear product priorities.</li>\n<li>Work closely with design to shape intuitive, engaging, and differentiated interactions.</li>\n<li>Think deeply about flows, states, feedback, discovery, and how users experience the product end to end.</li>\n<li>Drive activation, engagement, retention, and repeat usage.</li>\n<li>Work with engineering and AI teams to understand what is possible, where the experience can break, and the right product trade-offs.</li>\n<li>Use user behavior, research, experiments, and judgment to improve the product continuously.</li>\n<li>Prioritize sharply and move ideas from decision to users quickly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What We\u2019re Looking For</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3\u20136 years of product management experience, preferably in consumer technology.</li>\n<li>Experience building and shipping consumer products used at meaningful scale.</li>\n<li>Strong product taste and an instinct for good UX and interaction design.</li>\n<li>A deep understanding of user behavior and what makes experiences intuitive, useful, and habitforming.</li>\n<li>Ability to look beyond a feature request and solve the underlying user problem.</li>\n<li>Strong execution and prioritization skills.</li>\n<li>Comfort working through ambiguity and making decisions without perfect information.</li>\n<li>Strong cross-functional collaboration with design, engineering, data, and business teams.</li>\n<li>A hands-on relationship with generative AI.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You may have already shipped GenAI products, or you may be a strong consumer PM who actively experiments with AI and builds with it.&nbsp;What matters is that you are curious about what AI makes possible and can translate that into experiences that feel genuinely better for users.</p>\n<p><strong>How We Work</strong><br>We believe great products are built through strong judgment, rapid iteration, and close attention to the&nbsp;user experience.&nbsp;We test ideas early, learn quickly, and do not become attached to a solution simply because we built it.&nbsp;The best idea wins.&nbsp;We care about shipping, but shipping is not the goal. Building an experience users understand, enjoy,&nbsp;and return to is.</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span class=\"ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea\">\"<em>Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse's Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on 'Submit Application', you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.\"</em></span></p></div>",
