rong>ABOUT GLANCE TV</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Glance TV is an AI-powered shopping platform built for the living room. We're live on Samsung, Android TV, DirecTV, etc across the US, reaching millions of connected TVs. We're not porting mobile patterns to a bigger screen. We're figuring out what commerce and AI look like at ten feet, at scale, with a remote in someone's hand. Very few people in the world are working on this problem.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The design team is small and deliberately so. Everyone owns real surface area.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>THE ROLE</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">You'll own experiences end to end, from understanding the problem deeply to designs that engineering can build without guessing. Everything inside the experience is yours: the exploration, the flows, the edge cases, the polish, the follow-through after handoff.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Understand before you design.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Get clear on the feature's goal and the user need behind it. Ask why the problem exists before opening a canvas.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Explore more than one direction.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Show the alternatives you considered and why you chose the one you did. First idea is rarely the answer.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Design complete flows, not screens.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Connect the screens into one coherent experience. Loading, empty, error, first-run, offline. These are the states that decide whether a feature feels finished.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Ship polished UI.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Work fluently within the design system, extend it when you need to, and know the difference between the two.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Prototype to decide.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>On TV, motion and focus behaviour aren't decoration. They're the interaction. Build something clickable when a static frame can't answer the question.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Own delivery.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Work day to day with PM and engineering, hold the quality bar through build, and stay with the feature until it's live.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Make your reasoning visible.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Present the thinking, not just the outcome. Use whichever artifact makes the point fastest: a flow, a prototype, a comparison.</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Be good to work with.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Show up in critique, give useful feedback, help a peer when they're stuck.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>WHAT WE'RE NOT LOOKING FOR</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Designers who need a fully specced brief before they can start</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Beautiful screens with no answer to \"why this?\"</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Handing off a file and considering the work done</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Happy path only. The edge cases are where TV breaks</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Tool obsession over judgement. We don't care what you design in</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>WHO YOU ARE</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Roughly 2 to 4 years designing consumer products, with shipped work you can walk us through</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">A portfolio that shows decisions, not just outcomes: what you tried, what you dropped, what you'd change</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Genuinely high craft standards, and the restraint to know when something is done</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Comfortable with ambiguity, and comfortable asking questions when it's too much</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Curious about AI as a design material, not just a feature to bolt on</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Excited by a surface with no established playbook. TV experience is a bonus, not a requirement</li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span class=\"ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea\">\"<em>Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse's Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on 'Submit Application', you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.\"</em></span></p></div>",
