ities:\n<div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Localization &amp; Slate Production</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Manage the end-to-end operational pipeline for adapting and localizing international hit series into high-performing Dutch audio scripts.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Own production schedules, milestone tracking, and review queues across multiple simultaneous adaptation projects.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Ensure adapted scripts meet strict production timelines, technical delivery standards, and budget constraints.</span></p>\n</li>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Screenwriter Management &amp; Operations</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Lead, recruit, and manage a roster of freelance screenwriters across active project pods.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Set clear delivery milestones, track writer velocity, and enforce accountability on deadlines and revision cycles.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Provide clear, structured notes during review rounds to keep adaptation quality consistent without slowing down production.</span></p>\n</li>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">AI Workflow Integration</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Utilize AI tools and LLM workflows to accelerate translation, script adaptation, and review processes.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Train and guide screenwriters on using AI tools effectively to boost writing speed and maintain pipeline efficiency.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Continuously refine day-to-day localization workflows to leverage new AI capabilities while maintaining human editorial oversight.</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></ul></ul></div>\n\nWhat We're Looking For:\n<div>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Producing &amp; PM Experience: 3+ years in media production, script localization, project management, or editorial operations.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Writer Management: Proven experience managing screenwriters, translation teams, or freelance content creators to tight schedules.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">AI Workflow Literacy: Direct experience working within AI-enhanced content workflows and comfort using LLM tools to optimize speed and process.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Localization Expertise: Strong instinct for adapting global tropes, idioms, and narrative arcs to sound natural and culturally resonant for Dutch audiences.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Language Skills: Native or bilingual fluency in Dutch, with professional proficiency in English.</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n\nWhat Success Looks Like:\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">International series are localized and handed off to audio production on time and on budget.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">The screenwriting team operates efficiently within AI-assisted adaptation workflows.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">A scalable, predictable production engine is established for all localized Dutch content.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
