oncepts (POCs).</li>\n<li>Conduct enablement sessions to train partner field sales and systems engineering (SE) staff.</li>\n<li>Develop strategic relationships with key business leaders across the partner organization.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Who you are:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>A hardworking, driven, and highly motivated individual with a collaborative team spirit.</li>\n<li>Possess comprehensive knowledge of the Data Management, Data Protection, Storage industries or Cybersecurity.</li>\n<li>A confident communicator, highly capable of presenting to large audiences and hosting events.</li>\n<li>Adept at identifying and initiating deals with partners while working in close collaboration with Rubrik account teams.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Ideal background:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>5+ years of experience building and managing relationships specifically with <strong>Insight. Open to other national partner experience as well.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li>Strong orientation toward developing quarterly and annual partner business plans and sales activities.</li>\n<li>Proven track record of developing and executing channel programs, channel marketing plans, and coordinating joint marketing activities.</li>\n<li>Experience delivering sales and product training for resellers and at end-customer events.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated success in supporting partner sales reps to identify opportunities and close complex sales campaigns.</li>\n<li>A natural team player who is accustomed to highly collaborative, cross-functional work environments.</li>\n<li>Proficient in pipeline reporting, activity tracking, and accurate forecasting.</li>\n<li>Extensive experience selling competitive Backup and Recovery solutions, with a strong preference for experience in the Security space.</li>\n<li>Solid understanding of alliance and ecosystem vendors (e.g., EverPure, AWS, Microsoft, GCP), their value propositions, and how to build joint solutions with Rubrik.</li>\n<li>Ability to travel up to 50% of the time.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>#LI-MR2</p>\n<p>#LI-Remote</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h2>Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World's AI Transformation</h2>\n<p>Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/\">Linkedin</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/rubrikinc\">X (formerly Twitter)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com\">Rubrik.com</a></p>\n<h2>Inclusion @ Rubrik</h2>\n<p>At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world\u2019s data.</p>\n<p>Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.</p>\n<h3>Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\">Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1