rove content discoverability, engagement, and campaign performance.</li>\n<li>Help content and channel leads (Campaigns, SEO, Social, Paid, and Web) <strong>properly tag, promote, and cross-link</strong> assets across elastic.co and external digital marketing channels.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>What You Bring</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor\u2019s degree in a Marketing, English, Communications,\u202fJournalism,\u202for a related degree and/or relevant work experience&nbsp;</li>\n<li>5+ years on a content team in enterprise software/SaaS environments (demand gen team experience, recommended)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with both internal teams and external agencies.</li>\n<li>Experience measuring content effectiveness.</li>\n<li>Understanding of SEO and digital buyer journeys to drive organic content development, optimization, and retirement decisions.</li>\n<li>Experience in project management, with a consistent record of successfully using project management tools like Adobe Workfront, Jira, Monday.com, etc.</li>\n<li>Creative and critical thinking skills, with the ability to anticipate market trends and craft innovative content stories.</li>\n<li>Comfort collaborating with a highly distributed, global team of marketing and technology practitioners.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bonus Points</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Content experience on a global demand gen campaign team.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with AI-based tools like Jasper, SEMRushAIO, Writer, etc.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with content performance dashboards or data tools.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>#LI-JM5</p><div class=\"content-pay-transparency\"><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"description\"><p>Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary.&nbsp; This role does not have a variable compensation component.&nbsp; The typical starting salary range for new hires in this role is listed below.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>These ranges represent the lo