entify new and expansion opportunities for marketplaces by introducing and utilizing ISV co-sell benefits and aligning the sales teams for mutual success.</li>\n<li>Work closely with our sales leadership on developing, tracking, and reporting on account and opportunity progress with their cloud counterparts.</li>\n<li>Facilitate and run enablement to the field on the benefits of co-sell in our partner programs with each of the hyperscalers.</li>\n<li>Build and drive critical initiatives for scale with the Partner Sales team to further activate marketplace opportunities with the ecosystem.</li>\n<li>Develop a prioritization plan for coverage area based on sales and product team inputs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>What You Bring</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Upbeat, self-directed and hard-working business development and partner professional.</li>\n<li>Experience with selling ISV solutions on Marketplace and ISV Program benefits with one or more of the global hyperscalers.</li>\n<li>Exposure to and expertise with marketplace private offers and using various funding programs made available by the hyperscalers eg. Proof of Concept or Migration funding.</li>\n<li>Shown success growing the impact of cloud revenue through co-sell motions with sales teams.</li>\n<li>Ability to prioritize across a wide territory and handle diverse sets of collaborators.</li>\n<li>AI mentality: Use New Technologies for performance advantage and deal structuring</li>\n<li>Understanding of analytics, search, or big data markets / products or ability to learn quickly</li>\n<li>Willing to travel up to 10% of the time.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-pay-transparency\"><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"description\"><p>Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary plus a variable component.</p>\n<p>At Elastic, our compensation philosophy aims to provide fair, competitive and transparent remuneration. Salary ranges are established based on a combination of externa