-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"32ils-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"32ils-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">The ideal candidate possesses a robust quantitative background, at least 2 years of digital media experience, and an affinity for turning large datasets into actionable marketing insights. You are a self-motivated multitasker who takes extreme ownership of your work, collaborates seamlessly across teams, and constantly looks for ways to improve processes and exceed objectives.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"c6q1v-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"c6q1v-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What You Will Be Doing</span></span></strong></h2>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"3h713-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"3h713-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"3h713-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3h713-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Campaign Execution &amp; Optimization:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"3h713-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Manage the daily execution, audience targeting, creative coordination, and ongoing optimization of paid social campaigns to maximize ROI.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"4uk59-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"4uk59-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"4uk59-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Performance Reporting:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"4uk59-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Create performance reports for cross-functional stakeholders and manage weekly pacing reports to ensure budget alignment and campaign efficiency.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"7e8du-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"7e8du-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"7e8du-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Data Analysis &amp; Insights:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"7e8du-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Analyze large datasets to identify trends, draw meaningful conclusions, and translate complex data into clear, actionable insights.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"eags8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"eags8-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"eags8-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Technical Troubleshooting: </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"eags8-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">Fix issues with campaign setup, tracking, pixel implementation, and platform. </span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"a4j2f-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"a4j2f-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"a4j2f-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Prioritization &amp; Time Management:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"a4j2f-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Self-manage and prioritize a high volume of deliverables in a dynamic environment without sacrificing attention to detail.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"fqmto-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"fqmto-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What You Bring</span></span></strong></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"da3bp-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"da3bp-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"da3bp-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Qualifications &amp; Experience</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"3uqos-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"3uqos-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"3uqos-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3uqos-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Education:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"3uqos-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> BA/BS degree (or equivalent experience); a solid quantitative background is highly preferred.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Experience:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Minimum 2 years of experience in Digital Marketing or Marketing related field. Knowledge with paid social platforms including LinkedIn, </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-2\"><span data-text=\"true\">Meta, Pinterest, TikTok</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"1ngk-0-3\"><span data-text=\"true\">, or related advertising technologies</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"g209-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"g209-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Analytical Rigor:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Proven track record of working with large datasets, with advanced proficiency in Google Suite (including a robust command of </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-2\"><span data-text=\"true\">pivot tables</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-3\"><span data-text=\"true\"> and </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-4\"><span data-text=\"true\">VLOOKUPs</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"g209-0-5\"><span data-text=\"true\">).</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"3bvbb-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"3bvbb-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3bvbb-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Core Competencies:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"3bvbb-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Strong foundation in data analysis, performance reporting, audience targeting, and creative asset coordination.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dk51c\" data-offset-key=\"di426-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"di426-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"di426-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Desired Skills &amp; Attributes</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"3kk5e-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyl