loyment with Elastic.</span></p>\n<p>Please see&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA\">here</a>&nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.</p></div>",
