      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale \u2014 unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data \u2014 securing and protecting private information more effectively \u2014 Elastic\u2019s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.</p></div><h3><strong>What is The Role</strong></h3>\n<p><span data-offset-key=\"50c96-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">As a Principal in Sales Enablement, you will leverage your background as a top-performing Account Executive enable Elastic AEs. This role will working closely with AMER Sales Leadership to pinpoint performance gaps using data, designing tailored enablement and deliver the training that will genuinely help our sales team succeed. If you're motivated by the opportunity to </span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r1m:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"50c96-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">empower</span></span></span><span data-offset-key=\"50c96-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> others and create impactful learning experiences, this position allows you to do just that.</span></span></p>\n<h3><strong>What You Will Be Doing</strong></h3>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Diagnose Performance Gaps:</span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Partner directly with AMER Area and Regional VPs and RevOps to </span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r1o:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">analyze</span></span></span><span data-offset-key=\"bgnj6-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> sales data (Gong, Salesforce, Clari) and identify performance gaps and root causes in order to prescribe relevant targeted remediation.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"bfmh2-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"bfmh2-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"bfmh2-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Targeted Enablement:</span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"bfmh2-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Shift away from \"one-size-fits-all\" training. Design and deliver blended remediation programs tailored to specific seller cohorts showing performance gaps.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"digq-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"digq-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"digq-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">End-to-End Program Ownership:</span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"digq-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Orchestrate the entire lifecycle of AMER training experiences\u2014from initial scoping to live delivery and post-training reinforcement.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem 