s, and pipeline generation activities.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"cep5c-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"cep5c-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"cep5c-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Sales Tool Mastery:</span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"cep5c-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"><strong> </strong>Teach AEs how to leverage the sales tech stack and drive deep adoption and mastery of the AMER sales technology ecosystem, including Salesforce, Seismic, Clari, Outreach, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Demandbase, and Gong.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"cht33-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"cht33-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"cht33-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Develop and Maintain a Seller\u2019s Toolkit: </span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"cht33-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">Regularly audit self-serve enablement assets to ensure alignment with evolving processes. Identify overlapping sales tools to eliminate redundant friction and ensure our stack evolves alongside business needs.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"1cslp\" data-offset-key=\"51os9-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"51os9-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"51os9-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Connect Training to Sales Outcomes:</span></span></strong><span data-offset-key=\"51os9