twork architecture</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"f3m6k\" data-offset-key=\"6nihb-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"6nihb-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6nihb-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Track record of optimizing VPN and VDI deployments for performance and reliability</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"f3m6k\" data-offset-key=\"9hshk-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"9hshk-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"9hshk-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Demonstrated improvement in network security posture resulting from Zero Trust implementations</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"f3m6k\" data-offset-key=\"ah8i6-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"ah8i6-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"ah8i6-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Established best practices for network performance monitoring and reporting</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-pay-transparency\"><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"description\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary.&nbsp; This role does not have a variable compensation component.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The typical starting salary range for new hires in this role is listed below.&nbsp; In select locations (including Seattle WA, Los Angeles CA, the San Francisco Bay Area CA, and th