div>\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"dh6j3-0-0\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"dh6j3-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"dh6j3-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What You Will Be Doing</span></span></strong></div>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"a7u9e-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"a7u9e-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"a7u9e-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"a7u9e-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Design and implement scalable and robust application networking features to enhance performance. Integrate security controls into networking solutions, ensuring safe interactions. Refactor existing code to improve functionality and maintainability while leveraging AI tools to boost productivity for you and your team.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"d2qol-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"d2qol-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"d2qol-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Analyze performance metrics to pinpoint bottlenecks in application networking. Conduct load testing to assess scalability of networking features and optimize code to enhance response times and resource efficiency. Implement performance monitoring tools while collaborating with cross-functional teams to meet their application networking needs.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"aqqv8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"aqqv8-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"aqqv8-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Identify and tackle application networking issues to enhance performance. Conduct root cause analysis for network-related incidents and document the troubleshooting processes for future reference. Develop tools aimed at tracing and fixing errors associated with application networking.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"4p7d1-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"4p7d1-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"4p7d1-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Collaborate with Engineering teams across Elastic to discuss and fulfill their Application Networking requirements.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"aj8t3-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"aj8t3-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What You Bring</span></span></strong></div>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"cnjru-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"cnjru-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"cnjru-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"cnjru-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Hands-on experience developing software in Golang with an emphasis on networking components that can scale.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"akqnj-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"akqnj-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"akqnj-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Experience working with Kubernetes (Cilium, external-dns, Envoy Gateway &amp; Crossplane) are also great</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"3ok3o-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"3ok3o-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3ok3o-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Knowledge with at least one major cloud provider (AWS, Azure, or GCP) and their networking ecosystem</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"e6v4m-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"e6v4m-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"e6v4m-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Proficient in using AI tools to enhance code functionality and maintainability</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"e5iuk\" data-offset-key=\"4mptv-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"4mptv-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"4mptv-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Facilitated knowledge-sharing initiatives that promoted best practices in application networking across teams</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=