t Marketing, Content, and Brand teams to ensure aligned, cohesive messaging.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"3l6c6-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"3l6c6-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3l6c6-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Performance Insights:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"3l6c6-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Track campaign metrics to understand performance, refine tactics, and guide future campaign strategy.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>What You Bring</h3>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"plec-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"plec-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"plec-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">8+ years of experience in demand generation, revenue marketing, or growth marketing, with a focus on SaaS or enterprise security.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"fvbp8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"fvbp8-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"fvbp8-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Experience engaging security decision-makers and technical roles (e.g., CISOs, architects, engineers).</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"1l7le-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"1l7le-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"1l7le-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Background in modern demand generation, including ABM, lead nurturing, and funnel strategy.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"ad6ni-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"ad6ni-0-0\"><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r1c:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"ad6ni-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Strong</span></span></span><span data-offset-key=\"ad6ni-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> communication skills with an ability to simplify complex technical ideas for broader audiences.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"dmh01\" data-offset-key=\"6d8tp-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"6d8tp-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6d8tp-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Proficiency with marketing platforms such as Marketo and Salesforce.</span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>#LI-JM5</p><div class=\"content-pay-transparency\"><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"description\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary.&nbsp; This role does not have a variable compensation component.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The typical starting salary range for new hires in this role is listed below.&nbsp; In select locations (including Seattle WA, Los Angeles CA, the San Francisco Bay Area CA, and the New York City Metro Area), an alternate range may apply as specified below.&nbsp;</span>