      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale \u2014 unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data \u2014 securing and protecting private information more effectively \u2014 Elastic\u2019s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.</p></div><h3 class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"637gr-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"637gr-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What is the Role:</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"cg9ml-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"cg9ml-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"cg9ml-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Elastic is building a </span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r9o:\" class=\"chakra-text css-8zk7oi\"><span data-offset-key=\"cg9ml-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">dedicated</span></span></span><span data-offset-key=\"cg9ml-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> AI Native Accounts organization focused on partnering with the world's most innovative AI companies. We are seeking an extraordinary Strategic Account Executive to help define how the next generation of AI companies build, scale, and innovate using the Elastic Search AI Platform.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"1sgev-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"1sgev-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"1sgev-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">This is one of the most strategic individual contributor roles at Elastic.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"6u7uu-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"6u7uu-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6u7uu-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Rather than managing a broad territory, you will own a highly selective portfolio of globally strategic AI-native customers. You will work directly with executive and technical leaders to help solve some of the industry's most complex AI, search, and data challenges while accelerating adoption of the Elastic Search AI Platform.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"882qh-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"882qh-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"882qh-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Success in this role extends well beyond revenue attainment. You will serve as a trusted advisor, develop long-term executive relationships, influence product strategy through customer insight, and play a meaningful role in one of Elastic's highest-priority growth initiatives.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"63p20-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"63p20-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"63p20-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Location: Texas and West</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"63p20-0-0\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"f60vn-0-0\"><strong><span data-offset-key=\"f60vn-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Organizational Scope</span></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" dat