pan data-text=\"true\">Organizational Scope</span></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Each Strategic Account Executive is </span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r9q:\" class=\"chakra-text css-8zk7oi\"><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">responsible for</span></span></span><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> a small number of globally strategic AI-native customers. </span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r9s:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-3-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Rather than broad geographic coverage, this organization is intentionally designed around depth of </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:r9u:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-4-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">engagement</span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:ra0:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"2lqoe-5-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">, executive relationships, technical credibility, and long-term strategic partnerships.</span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"b6qdo-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"b6qdo-0-0\"><span id=\"popover-trigger-:ra2:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"b6qdo-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">This role works closely with Solutions Architecture, Product Management, Engineering, Customer Success, Marketing, Strategic Alliances, and Executive Leadership to deliver extraordinary customer outcomes while helping shape Elastic's </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:ra4:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span da