et-key=\"6mghu-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> forecasting, opportunity inspection, and operational excellence.</span></span></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"6n4e9-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6n4e9-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">What You Bring:</span></span></h3>\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"2u232-0-0\">\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"2u232-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"2u232-0-0\"><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rao:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"2u232-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Enterprise Sales Excellence: </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"2u232-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">A proven track record of consistently exceeding quota while managing complex enterprise software sales cycles involving executive stakeholders, technical decision-makers, and global organizations.</span></span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"1gdm3-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"1gdm3-0-0\"><span id=\"popover-trigger-:raq:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"1gdm3-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">AI &amp; Modern Infrastructure Expertise: </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:ras:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"1gdm3-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Strong</span></span></span> <span id=\"popover-trigger-:rb0:\" class=\"chakra-text css-8zk7oi\"><span data-offset-key=\"1gdm3-3-0\"><span data-text=\"t