\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"qib0-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Strategic Thinking: </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"qib0-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">Ability to develop long-term account strategies, identify growth opportunities, navigate complex organizations, and execute against multi-year customer plans.</span></span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"112aa\" data-offset-key=\"fi16i-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"fi16i-0-0\"><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rba:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Cross-Functional </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbc:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-1-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Leadership</span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbe:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-2-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">: </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-2-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">Proven ability to collaborate </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbg:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-3-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">effectively</span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbi:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-4-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"> across Sales, Solutions Architecture, Product Management, Engineering, Customer Success, Marketing, and Strategic Alliances to deliver </span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbk:\" class=\"chakra-text css-1j6t0d7\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-5-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">exceptional</span></span></span><span id=\"popover-trigger-:rbm:\" class=\"chakra-text css-bcri66\"><span data-offset-key=\"fi16i-6-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">