th a track record of hiring, developing, and managing senior individual contributors.</li>\n<li>Solid understanding of payments \u2014 familiarity with card schemes, payment method integrations, and API-based payment flows is strongly preferred.</li>\n<li>Comfortable with technical concepts at the API and systems level; able to engage credibly with engineers and technical partners without needing to be a hands-on software engineer.</li>\n<li>Proven experience driving operational improvements \u2014 identifying the root causes of recurring issues and building sustainable processes, tooling, or automation to address them.</li>\n<li>Strong communicator and cross-functional influencer; comfortable navigating ambiguity and driving alignment across Product, Engineering, Commercial, and external partner teams.</li>\n<li>Ability to build and maintain trusted relationships with senior internal stakeholders and payment partner counterparts.</li>\n<li>High agency: you don't wait for direction. You identify opportunities, form a point of view, get alignment, and move.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Our Diversity, Equity and Inclusion commitments&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our unique approach is a product of our diverse perspectives. This diversity of backgrounds and cultures is essential in helping us maintain our momentum. Our business and technical challenges are unique, and we need as many different voices as possible to join us in solving them - voices like yours. No matter who you are or where you\u2019re from, we welcome you to be your true self at Adyen.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Studies show that women and members of underrepresented communities apply for jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. Does this sound like you? If so, Adyen encourages you to reconsider and apply. We look forward to your application!</span></p>\n<p><strong>What\u2019s next?</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ensuring 