      "description": "<h2><strong>This is Adyen</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Meta, Uber, H&amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they are enabled to truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.</span></p>\n<h3><strong>Team Lead, Implementation</strong></h3>\n<p>Adyen is looking for an experienced and motivated leader to join our Professional Services Team to lead a team of Implementation Engineers in North America. You will join a group of peers to propel our Implementation Team to new heights, setting the standard in the industry. This position is based out of our San Francisco office.</p>\n<p>The Implementation Engineering team supports our large and strategic customers in solution design, integrating and going live in the quickest and most sustainable way possible, with use of comprehensive product knowledge. Implementation Engineers work on innovative complex projects ranging from Online payments integrations, In-Person Payments (IPP), Marketplaces, Card issuing programs and Financial Services.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Lead a team of implementation managers to deliver a great customer experience and get customers live efficiently, with robust integrations that scale well.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Act as a sparring partner and escalation layer for the team of implementation managers, helping to navigate complex projects and technical challenges.</li>\n<l