isability, protected veteran status, or any other legally protected characteristics. At Turing we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive and authentic workplace&nbsp;&nbsp;and celebrate authenticity, so if you\u2019re excited about this role but your past experience doesn\u2019t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">For applicants from the European Union, please review&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.turing.com/policy\" target=\"_blank\">Turing's GDPR notice here</a>.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div></div>",
