ty, analytics, compliance, and coaching to understand their data and enrichment needs and ensure the vehicle data platform enables their solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"10\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Define and execute OEM integration strategy</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, expanding vehicle data coverage through partnerships with truck and vehicle OEMs and support for proprietary data protocols.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"10\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Establish and maintain the vehicle data contract</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;\u2014 schema, supported parameters, ADAS event types, decoration logic, and delivery mechanisms \u2014 so consuming teams have a reliable, well-documented interface.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\uf0b7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"10\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quo